<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/_head', { title: '找不到頁面' }) %>
    <style>
        body {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .error-card {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 480px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 48px 40px;
            background-color: var(--card-bg-color);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px var(--shadow-color);
        }
        .error-emoji { font-size: 4em; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .error-code {
            font-size: 5em;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--border-color);
            line-height: 1;
            margin: 0 0 8px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: var(--heading-color);
            font-size: 1.4em;
            margin: 0 0 12px;
        }
        p { color: var(--text-color); margin: 0 0 28px; }
        .link-group { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-card">
        <div class="error-emoji">🐾</div>
        <p class="error-code">404</p>
        <h1>找不到這個頁面</h1>
        <p>這隻毛孩走丟了！您要找的頁面不存在或已被移除。</p>
        <div class="link-group">
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">回到首頁</a>
            <a href="/shelter-animals" class="btn btn-primary" style="background:#a77b5a">瀏覽收容動物</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
